      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1300580421,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 277571333,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752162509668,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design an Online Judge system that can run contests where users solve algorithmic questions\nWe already have a few thousand registered users already\nContest has a start and end time\nOn start, problems are published on the contest site\nUsers can solve problems in any order\nSolutions are either accepted or rejected\nThere's a ranking table showing scores - ranking depends on number of failed attempts and submission time only (NOT solution run time)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design an Online Judge system that can run contests where users solve algorithmic questions\nWe already have a few thousand registered users already\nContest has a start and end time\nOn start, problems are published on the contest site\nUsers can solve problems in any order\nSolutions are either accepted or rejected\nThere's a ranking table showing scores - ranking depends on number of failed attempts and submission time only (NOT solution run time)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "8ysQQ5iyjDopMCG2hQmb0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -277.3898162841797,
      "y": -401,
      "width": 1158.31884765625,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1822291877,
      "version": 1219,
      "versionNonce": 495335371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752162509668,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- should allow list contests - there is only one at a time\n- should allow users to join a contest\n- should allow users to list contest problems\n- should allow users to submit solutions to problems\n- should allow users to see contest rakings\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n- 100K users per contest\n- Contest is running N hours (average 12h)\n- 3-7 problems per contest (average of 3 submissions per problem)\n- high availability on read (contests)\n- high availability on test problem solution builds / high consistency on submition writes (for raking and contest times)\n\nAPI:\n\nGET /contests -> List<Contest>\nGET /contests/<id>/problems -> List<Problem>\nPOST /contests/<id>/join -> HPPT 200 - Status\nPOST /contests/<id>/problems/<problem_id>\nGET /contests/<id>/rankings -> Page<Ranking> // by default page containing current user\nGET /contests/<id>/rankings/page/<page_number>\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- should allow list contests - there is only one at a time\n- should allow users to join a contest\n- should allow users to list contest problems\n- should allow users to submit solutions to problems\n- should allow users to see contest rakings\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n- 100K users per contest\n- Contest is running N hours (average 12h)\n- 3-7 problems per contest (average of 3 submissions per problem)\n- high availability on read (contests)\n- high availability on test problem solution builds / high consistency on submition writes (for raking and contest times)\n\nAPI:\n\nGET /contests -> List<Contest>\nGET /contests/<id>/problems -> List<Problem>\nPOST /contests/<id>/join -> HPPT 200 - Status\nPOST /contests/<id>/problems/<problem_id>\nGET /contests/<id>/rankings -> Page<Ranking> // by default page containing current user\nGET /contests/<id>/rankings/page/<page_number>\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
